+// v8xx NEF: the NOINTER class (common_flags.h). Each team's reach as tools/lab/genmaps.team_reach: walk (8 directions) and dash (a
+// tile at Chebyshev 2 with a non-wall tile adjacent to both ends, holes crossable), then one crystal jump (Chebyshev 3, any terrain)
+// and walk + dash on; walls, holes, altars and the other spawn are not landable; camps are passable. True when no tile of the
